# The Challenge: one headline statement per folder file

Each module `Challenge.FolderNN` states the headline theorem of `Grothendieck/FolderNN.lean`
(the one the Lean appendix of the paper presents as the folder's main verified statement),
with `sorry`, together with the definitions its statement depends on, copied verbatim from the
library under the same names. The choices are listed in `CHALLENGE.md`.
